#MOBILE
Vnum       40900
Keywords   screech lizard lizard~
Short      a screech lizard~
Long       A mottled lizard the length of a forearm freezes on a rock, watching you sideways.
~
Desc       Screech lizards take their name from the extraordinary volume they
produce when alarmed, which is out of all proportion to their size and
is generally the first warning a traveller gets that anything else is
nearby.
~
