#ROOM
Vnum     40900
Name     Tythos Ridge Crossroads~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     Nine trails meet on this broad, grassy saddle between two low hills,
worn into the turf by centuries of Je'daii feet and never once paved.
From here the whole of the central highlands opens out: pale grassland
running north toward the ruins, dark ak forest crowding the east, and
the ground falling away south into haze. A weathered marker stone
leans at the centre, its carved directions long since softened past
reading.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40902
#ENDEXIT
