#ROOM
Vnum     40901
Name     Windflower Rise~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     The grass thins on this rise to let bare rock show through, streaked
with the small white flowers that open only in Tython's short
mornings. The wind comes hard and constant off the northwestern peaks,
carrying the cold of snowfields that never quite melt.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40902
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40904
#ENDEXIT
