#ROOM
Vnum     40902
Name     The Long Approach~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     The grassland runs level and unbroken here, deep enough in places to
hide a crouching figure and loud with insects. Far to the north, low
shapes on the horizon resolve slowly into walls that were old before
the Temples were raised.
~
#EXIT
