#ROOM
Vnum     40903
Name     Terrace Foot~
Sector   hills~
Flags    ~
Desc     The land begins to step upward here in long shallow terraces, each one
banked with stone so weathered it might be natural. Whoever cut them
is not recorded; the Je'daii simply inherited them and planted grain.
~
