Name     Sunward Grass~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     Warm, open, and gently sloping, this stretch of grassland catches the
light for most of the day. Wildflowers grow thick between the
tussocks, and the air smells of dry seed heads and crushed stems.
~
