#ROOM
Vnum     40906
Name     Cairnfield~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     Hundreds of small stone cairns stand in the grass here, none higher
than a knee, arranged in no pattern that reveals itself from ground
level. Je'daii passing through have added to them for so long that the
practice has outlived its explanation.
~
