Name     Grey Heath~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     The grass gives way to a low grey-green heather that crunches
underfoot and releases a sharp resinous smell. The ground ahead falls
steadily southward toward a line of broken cloud that never seems to
move.
~
